6150..6226 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6227..6301 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6302..6378 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6379..6453 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6454..6462 Comment "/// `g`."
